\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0   All Christians, and the Church,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Put on your good armour
\par And be so strong in all your life
\par In the power of God.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.   Almighty Jehovah
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 O God Omnipotent
\par will give to His children His pow'r
\par and make them strong to fight.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   3.   Get on and take with you
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0   the great armour of God
\par   that will make you to stand all day
\par  till the end of the fight.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  4.  Be strong and stand so firm
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0  be sharp in all your fight
\par  and He will lead you to succeed
\par \pard     in everlasting peace.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

